{title: Vaseegara}
{artist: Bombay Jayashri Harris Jayaraj}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        vaseegaraa en nenjinikka
[Am] [G],        un pon madiyil thoonginaal poadhum
[Am],        adhae kaNam en kaNNuRanga mun
[Am] [G],        jenmangaLin aekkangaL theerum
[Am] [G] [F],        naan naesippadhum suvaasippadhum
[G] [Am],        un dhayavaal thaanae
[G] [F],        aengugiRaen aengugiRaen
[E] [Am],        un ninaivaal naanae naan
[Am],        adai mazhai varum adhil nanaivoamae
[Em],        kuLir kaaychchaloadhu snekam
[Dm] [C] [E],        oru poarvaikkuL iru thookkam
[Am],        kuLu kuLu poygaL solli enai velvaay
[Em],        adhu therindhum kooda anbae
[Dm] [C] [E],        manam adhaiyaedhaan edhirpaarkkum
[Am] [Em],        engaeyum poagaamal
[F] [G],        dhinam veettilaeyae nee vaendum
[Am] [G],        sila samayam viLaiyaattaay
[Dm] [E],        un aadaikkuL naan vaendum
[Am],        dhinam nee kuLiththadhum enaith thaedi
[Em],        en saelai nuniyaal undhan
[Dm] [C] [E],        thalai thudaippaayae adhu kavidhai
[Am],        thirudan poal padhungiyae dhideer enru
[Em],        pinnaalirundhu ennai
[Dm] [C] [E],        nee aNaippaayae adhu kavidhai
[Am] [Em],        yaaraenum maNi kaettaal
[F] [G],        adhai solla kooda theriyaadhae
[Am] [G],        kaadhalenum mudivinile
[Dm] [E],        gadigaara naeram kidaiyaadhae
